# Rule File Format

Each rule file has YAML frontmatter:
- `title`: Concept name
- `impact`: CRITICAL | HIGH | MEDIUM
- `impactDescription`: Why this concept matters
- `tags`: Comma-separated search terms

Rule files are self-contained. Read them individually, not in bulk.
Prefer loading CRITICAL impact rules first when multiple rules are relevant.
